Note that the spell of remove curse has a downside when you're trying on
unidentified armour: while you're wearing a cursed plate mail your
chances of succesfully casting a spell go down enormously, so you might
not be able to cast remove curse at all. Just drag every piece of armour
to the Mine Town Temple and try for cursedness first. The cursed pieces
of armour are rarely better than +0 anyway.

